          "id": "4b37254efe502f8a0aeba36076130ed9b44853ef",
          "message": "chore(release): prepare exact-source v0.1.2 recovery (#6541)\n\n* chore(release): prepare exact-source v0.1.2 recovery\n\nBump the workspace and all three public npm packages without upgrading external dependencies. Preserve the path-only introspection test dependency and private LWS version. Reconcile local package identities in Cargo locks, distinguish the immutable incomplete v0.1.1 history from post-tag changes, and single-source conditional registry install instructions for README and mdBook.\n\nCo-Authored-By: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>\n\n* fix(security): update rustls for RUSTSEC-2026-0285\n\n* chore(security): record patched TLS dependency trust\n\n* fix(release): close v0.1.2 review gaps\n\n* fix(ci): fetch pinned OWL archive over HTTPS\n\nUse HTTPS for the Internet Archive transport while preserving the captured HTTP-origin snapshot and SHA-256 pin. Keep cache and ratchet behavior unchanged, and guard the URL and pins with a hermetic regression test.\n\nCo-Authored-By: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: GPT-6 <noreply@openai.com>",
